  "description": "OEDRO off-road rear bumper combination is suitable for 07-18 Jeep Wrangler JK, Unlimited, Sahara, and Rubicon. This rear bumper is made of a durable 5/32\" steel plate and 2\"X0.120\" steel pipe. It not only makes your car look stronger but also protects your car in the event of a collision. Jeep rear insurance The bars use high-quality texture black powder coating, combined with our advanced laser welding technology to prevent rust.\nFeatures\nMaintain your vehicle’s resale value. If you eventually decide to sell your car, it will be worth more if the bumper is in good shape than if it’s marked up with dings and dents.\nAdditional Protection for Your Vehicle. Your bumper exists primarily to protect your car. Particularly if you drive a large vehicle or do a lot of off-road driving, a high-quality bumper provides extra protection against the environment. The strong steel also protects your vehicle from possible collisions and accidents.\nHeightened Durability. Made with a high-quality textured black powder coat and laser welding procedure, better prevent rust.\nElevated Style. There’s nothing wrong with wanting some additional style on your vehicle. A well-designed bumper elevates the appearance of your truck, making it look cool while keeping it functional.\n1 years warranty. For your safety, professional installation recommended.\nFitment\nFits for 2007-2018 Jeep Wrangler JK all models. (Includes Unlimited, Rubicon, Sahara).\nNote: The shackle is not designed for towing and recovery, refer to the owner's manual for towing and rescue information. Overload is not included in after-sales service.",
